obs.quote:
Lapwings to-night.
They commenced to arrive at 7.40 P.M., and continued until 11 P.M.;
hundreds constantly flying round the lantern, within the rays of light

November 8th, thirty; 9th, sixty;
11th, several; 15th, two hundred; 22d, eighteen; 23d, seventy; all
going E. in November

